"Fix round 1 of 2 for task T2: Implement CSV serialization.

## Review findings to address

1. **[blocker] Newlines are not quoted** — \`src/reports/csv.ts:12\`

   A field containing \`\\n\` is emitted raw, which splits the row.

   Suggested fix: Quote fields matching /[",\\n\\r]/.

## Acceptance criteria the reviewer did not consider met

- **AC1** (unmet): newline case fails

## Failed verification

- \`pnpm vitest run src/reports/csv.test.ts\`: failed (exit 1), 2.3s

